  - MATCH,通用代理
  # 精确 GitHub 服务优先于 CDN 判断；CF IP 匹配需解析真实地址。
  # 每个分支紧跟 UDP 护栏，防止选中 TCP-only 节点后滑落到其他探针或直连。
  # API/Release 仅分别借网页/归档探针近似判断，不承诺业务级可用。
  分流-探针分类:
  - SUB-RULE,(DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com),分流-GitHubRaw-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com)),REJECT
  - SUB-RULE,(OR,((DOMAIN,codeload.github.com),(DOMAIN,release-assets.githubusercontent.com))),分流-GitHub归档-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(OR,((DOMAIN,codeload.github.com),(DOMAIN,release-assets.githubusercontent.com)))),REJECT
  - SUB-RULE,(OR,((DOMAIN,github.com),(DOMAIN,api.github.com))),分流-GitHub-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(OR,((DOMAIN,github.com),(DOMAIN,api.github.com)))),REJECT
  - SUB-RULE,(OR,((RULE-SET,cloudflare_domain),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_domain),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_ipv4),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_ipv6))),分流-CF-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(OR,((RULE-SET,cloudflare_domain),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_domain),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_ipv4),(RULE-SET,cloudflare_cdn_ipv6)))),REJECT
  - SUB-RULE,(RULE-SET,github_domain),分流-GitHub-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(RULE-SET,github_domain)),REJECT
  - SUB-RULE,(OR,((NETWORK,tcp),(NETWORK,udp))),分流-Google-出口
  - AND,((NETWORK,udp),(OR,((NETWORK,tcp),(NETWORK,udp)))),REJECT
  - MATCH,REJECT
